Busy, Busy FIGGGY BAR of 6 July 1989. Among the MANY items discussed: Source/
CompuServe merger, Buffalo (Chuck) Chip, ACM SigForth, MPP,Kitt's Peak job,
Roedy Green conf 20 July, 1's compliment, Internet Worm, Forth stro-srot-sort 
routines, B-tree, report generators, Object Oriented Forth, SC32, Single
Boards, FORGET FORGET, Telecomm as a tool, BASIS8

